---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL } from '../data/downloads'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — BP Analyst"
  description="Draft privacy notice for BP Analyst extension and marketing site. For qualified counsel review."
>
  <article class="legal">
    <header class="legal__header">
      <p class="legal__eyebrow">Legal draft</p>
      <h1 class="legal__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal__lede">
        <strong>Draft for qualified legal counsel review</strong> — not licensed
        legal advice and not a final counsel-approved policy. Last updated 6
        November 2026.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="legal__body">
      <section>
        <h2>Controller</h2>
        <p>
          Controller: Ilya Titov (individual), established in the EU/EEA.
          Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>.
          Postal address and Member State supervisory authority:
          <em>to be completed with counsel</em>. Independent project — not
          affiliated with Beatport or The Beatport Group LLC.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Extension data</h2>
        <p>
          On Beatport list pages the extension may hold track metadata already
          loaded by Beatport (including title, artists, BPM, key, label, genre,
          dates, price, flags, ISRC when present, URLs, preview URLs), page URL
          and title, and your key-notation preference. Live snapshots use
          session storage per tab. Key notation uses local extension storage.
          Snapshots are not uploaded to servers operated by the extension
          author. Preview audio requests go from your browser to Beatport media
          hosts. CSV export stays on your device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Marketing site</h2>
        <p>
          Hosted on Vercel (logs may include IP and request metadata). Optional
          Google Analytics 4 uses Consent Mode (tag may load with analytics
          storage denied until Accept). Yandex Metrika loads only after Accept.
          Reject is equally available; reopen via Cookie settings. Consent is
          stored in <code>localStorage</code> as{' '}
          <code>bp-analyst-analytics-consent</code>. The site does not receive
          extension track snapshots.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Transfers and sharing</h2>
        <p>
          Analytics vendors (Google / Yandex) process data only after consent;
          international transfers require appropriate GDPR Chapter V safeguards
          (confirm with counsel). Hosting uses Vercel. Extension snapshots are
          not sold by the author.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Retention and rights</h2>
        <p>
          Session snapshots end with the browser session. Clear extension data
          or uninstall to remove local preferences. Withdraw analytics consent
          anytime via Cookie settings. GDPR rights requests:{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>. You may
          complain to your supervisory authority.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>Aimed at adult music producers; not directed to children.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Canonical copy</h2>
        <p>
          Repository markdown:{' '}
          <a href="https://github.com/ilyatitovich/bp-analyst/blob/main/PRIVACY.md">
            PRIVACY.md
          </a>
          . Related drafts: <a href="/cookies">Cookies</a>,{' '}
          <a href="/terms">Terms</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  @layer components {
    .legal {
      display: grid;
      gap: var(--space-8);
      padding-block: calc(5.5rem + var(--space-7)) var(--space-9);
      max-inline-size: 42rem;
    }

    .legal__eyebrow {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--color-fg-subtle);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .legal__title {
      margin: var(--space-2) 0 0;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .legal__lede {
      margin: var(--space-4) 0 0;
      color: var(--color-fg-muted);
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .legal__body {
      display: grid;
      gap: var(--space-7);
    }

    .legal__body h2 {
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: var(--text-xl);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .legal__body p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--color-fg-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .legal__body a {
      color: var(--color-accent);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
    }

    .legal__body code {
      font-size: 0.92em;
      color: var(--color-fg);
    }
  }
</style>
